VERSION ""

NS_ :

BS_:

BU_: PCM VSA SCM BODY EPS

CM_ "Honda Civic 2014 (9a geracao), F-CAN 500 kbit/s, IDs de 11 bits.
Mapeamento construido sobre os logs reais can-sample-0.log / can-sample-1.log.
Prefixo de confianca no comentario de cada sinal:
  [CONFIRMADO] comportamento verificado nos logs (curva, correlacao, eco em outro ID)
  [OPENDBC]    layout do opendbc (honda_*), coerente com os logs mas nao exercitado
  [HIPOTESE]   palpite; use so como pista
Todo frame com checksum Honda tem COUNTER (bits 5:4) e CHECKSUM (bits 3:0) no ultimo byte.";

BO_ 316 GAS_PEDAL_2: 8 PCM
 SG_ ENGINE_TORQUE_ESTIMATE : 7|16@0- (1,0) [-1000|1000] "Nm" EPS
 SG_ ENGINE_TORQUE_REQUEST : 23|16@0- (1,0) [-1000|1000] "Nm" EPS
 SG_ CAR_GAS : 39|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" EPS
 SG_ COUNTER : 61|2@0+ (1,0) [0|3] "" EPS
 SG_ CHECKSUM : 59|4@0+ (1,0) [0|15] "" EPS

BO_ 344 ENGINE_DATA: 8 PCM
 SG_ XMISSION_SPEED : 7|16@0+ (0.01,0) [0|250] "kph" EPS
 SG_ XMISSION_SPEED2 : 39|16@0+ (0.01,0) [0|250] "kph" EPS
 SG_ COUNTER : 61|2@0+ (1,0) [0|3] "" EPS
 SG_ CHECKSUM : 59|4@0+ (1,0) [0|15] "" EPS

BO_ 380 POWERTRAIN_DATA: 8 PCM
 SG_ PEDAL_GAS : 7|8@0+ (1,0) [0|255] "" EPS
 SG_ ENGINE_RPM : 23|16@0+ (1,0) [0|15000] "rpm" EPS
